    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESENTATION</h2><br>This is a 2D old-school RPG in the vein of Black Home and A Plunge into Darkness.<br><br>After a devastating Plague purged most of humanity, the few who survived escaped to the underground, in an attempt to survive the disease. After a decade of living in the dark, away from the world. Bahar, and his wife Guidry, believe the Plague has ceased to be and are on the pursuit of a way out, a way back to the world they once knew.<br><br>The path is long and perilous, but they will walk it bravely so their children, Dan and Ava, can finally start living instead of just surviving.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br>A touching storyline that will resonate with all of us given the latest circumstances<br>An adventurous pace that will keep you on your toes<br>Explore the underground world, a place full of mystery and dangers<br>Auto-save feature to keep you from meaningless repetition",
